Business Recommendations
1. Focus on Premium Brands

Brands like Kawasaki, Yamaha, and Royal Enfield consistently dominate listings and should receive priority in inventory planning.

2. Increase Electric Bike Inventory

Electric bikes represent nearly one-third of the market, indicating increasing customer acceptance and future growth potential.

3. Promote High Resale Value Models

Models with strong resale value can be highlighted in marketing campaigns to attract value-conscious buyers.

4. Optimize Pricing Strategy

Compare selling prices across brands and models to identify underpriced or overpriced listings and improve pricing decisions.

5. Target Newer Manufacturing Years

Recent manufacturing years (2022–2024) show strong market activity, making them ideal for promotional campaigns.